      <h3>Product Management at ByteDance</h3>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Study TikTok's product deeply: content ranking, creator tools, monetization (ads, LIVE gifts, shopping), and the For You Page algorithm — form opinions on what works, what doesn't, and what you'd build next</li>
        <li>Be prepared to discuss A/B testing methodology, metric tradeoffs (engagement vs. creator retention vs. user wellbeing), and content moderation at scale</li>
        <li>ByteDance's cross-cultural product context (China + US + global) often surfaces — understanding how global products adapt is a differentiator</li>
      </ul>
      <h3 style="margin-top:20px;">Navigating regulatory uncertainty</h3>
      <ul class="checklist">
